a Hxe Blue, has a hobby that she can’t tell anybody about… Kirara finds out about Sora’s secret, and Sora makes Kirara take part in her antics.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5dZekwhD0jlxi2TG65r2Vr3io0K.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Maihime Shirayuki has a laid-back personality and can’t play sports to save her life. She was chosen to be a member of HxEROS because of her hidden eros and became Hxe White, but she lacks confidence because she thinks she doesn’t have any strengths that set her apart. A Kiseichuu appears at the all-girls high school that Maihime goes to, but how will she fight this enemy and its menacing tentacles? Meanwhile, Sora Tenkuji, aka Hxe Blue, has a hobby that she can’t tell anybody about… Kirara finds out about Sora’s secret, and Sora makes Kirara take part in her antics.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5dZekwhD0jlxi2TG65r2Vr3io0K.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15241","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"112818","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40623","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"96120","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"378049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"45940","synopsis":"Retto and others head to a nest of Kiseichuus to rescue Kirara who was abducted during a battle. Meanwhile, Kirara sets herself free from an enemy restraint and wanders alone in the nest. She comes across Chacha, a princess of Kiseichuus, who is considered different from the others due to her mutation and has been imprisoned. Chacha wants to stop her other comrades from destroying humanity and plans an escape with Kirara. Retto and others finally arrive at the nest and charge head-on, but…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mZmwBK34psRAIZrcnuQ81bPqFrl.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Retto and others head to a nest of Kiseichuus to rescue Kirara who was abducted during a battle. Meanwhile, Kirara sets herself free from an enemy restraint and wanders alone in the nest. She comes across Chacha, a princess of Kiseichuus, who is considered different from the others due to her mutation and has been imprisoned. Chacha wants to stop her other comrades from destroying humanity and plans an escape with Kirara. Retto and others finally arrive at the nest and charge head-on, but…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mZmwBK34psRAIZrcnuQ81bPqFrl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15241","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"112818","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40623","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"96120","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"378049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"46540","synopsis":"Chacha joins HXEROS as a new member and starts living with the team in the same dormitory. Chacha enters Retto’s consciousness to find the source of his H-energy. While still merged with Retto’s consciousness, she visits the rooms of Maihime, Momoka, and Sora and stimulates their H-energy. She ends up taking a bath with Kirara, which makes Retto antsy. Chacha’s powers are too much for Kirara, who faints from the heat. Chacha realizes that Retto is in love with Kirara and takes control over his body while whispering to him that now is his chance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/30fUkaKXT6usmR7ii02FBSpLcVp.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Chacha joins HXEROS as a new member and starts living with the team in the same dormitory. Chacha enters Retto’s consciousness to find the source of his H-energy. While still merged with Retto’s consciousness, she visits the rooms of Maihime, Momoka, and Sora and stimulates their H-energy. She ends up taking a bath with Kirara, which makes Retto antsy. Chacha’s powers are too much for Kirara, who faints from the heat. Chacha realizes that Retto is in love with Kirara and takes control over his body while whispering to him that now is his chance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/30fUkaKXT6usmR7ii02FBSpLcVp.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15241","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"112818","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40623","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"96120","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"378049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"47290","synopsis":"Recently in Saitama, public concern has been mounting over large numbers of people that have been oversleeping in the morning, resulting in them being late for school or work. Based on intel from Chacha, Retto and the team figure out that the culprit behind all of this is Genmuchuu. They head over to its hideout which is an abandoned radio tower, but Genmuchuu welcomes them with a surprise attack that traps them in a dream world. Will Retto be able to awaken from a fantasy-filled dream state and defeat Genmuchuu?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rVfCoo1GDtVxfC6z91v99J7XCOI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Recently in Saitama, public concern has been mounting over large numbers of people that have been oversleeping in the morning, resulting in them being late for school or work. Based on intel from Chacha, Retto and the team figure out that the culprit behind all of this is Genmuchuu. They head over to its hideout which is an abandoned radio tower, but Genmuchuu welcomes them with a surprise attack that traps them in a dream world. Will Retto be able to awaken from a fantasy-filled dream state and defeat Genmuchuu?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rVfCoo1GDtVxfC6z91v99J7XCOI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15241","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"112818","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40623","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"96120","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"378049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"47680","synopsis":"Kirara has been suffering from hallucinations where she sees Dark Kirara, the shadow side of her personality, in the form of her childhood self. Dark Kirara says that her purpose for appearing is to make Kirara and Retto into a couple. At first, Kirara does not listen to her meddlesome alter ego, but after seeing Shiko make passes at Retto, she can no longer contain herself. Flustered by the arrival of this unexpected rival, she heads over to the bathtub to find Retto, after Dark Kirara whispers in her ear to make a move…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9WACiIKBR8OpOcUN8GwyvRa4Oep.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Kirara has been suffering from hallucinations where she sees Dark Kirara, the shadow side of her personality, in the form of her childhood self. Dark Kirara says that her purpose for appearing is to make Kirara and Retto into a couple. At first, Kirara does not listen to her meddlesome alter ego, but after seeing Shiko make passes at Retto, she can no longer contain herself. Flustered by the arrival of this unexpected rival, she heads over to the 